on was $25 billion in FY2025, 6.2% of revenue, against 7.1% in FY2020.","cites":["GOOGL.sbc.2025","GOOGL.revenue.2025","GOOGL.sbc.2020","GOOGL.revenue.2020"]},{"topic":"returns","text":"In FY2025 the company paid $45.7 billion to repurchase its own shares and $10 billion in dividends: $55.8 billion together (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["GOOGL.buybacks.2025","GOOGL.dividends.2025"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-09-30 revenue was $128 billion, up 24.7% from $102 billion in the three months ended 2025-09-30.","cites":["GOOGL.d.revenue.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","GOOGL.d.revenue.2025-07-01.2025-09-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-09-30 revenue added up to $471 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $157 billion and net income to $236 billion.","cites":["GOOGL.d.revenue.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","GOOGL.d.revenue.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","GOOGL.d.revenue.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","GOOGL.d.revenue.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","GOOGL.d.revenue.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","GOOGL.d.opinc.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","GOOGL.d.opinc.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","GOOGL.d.opinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","GOOGL.d.opinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","GOOGL.d.opinc.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","GOOGL.d.netinc.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","GOOGL.d.netinc.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","GOOGL.d.netinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","GOOGL.d.netinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","GOOGL.d.netinc.2026-07-01.2026-09-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $19.7 billion: operating cash flow of $180 billion less capital spending of $160 billion (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["GOOGL.d.ocf.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","GOOGL.d.ocf.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","GOOGL.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","GOOGL.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-06-30","GOOGL.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-09-30","GOOGL.d.capex.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","GOOGL.d.capex.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","GOOGL.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","GOOGL.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-06-30","GOOGL.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-09-30"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The proxy statement filed 2026-04-24 gives the principal executive officer’s total pay for FY2025 as $10.9 million in its summary compensation table, and the “compensation actually paid” - the SEC’s measure, which revalues share awards over the year - as $214 million.","cites":["GOOGL.pay.peoTotal.2025","GOOGL.pay.peoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $32.9 million in total and $101 million actually paid.","cites":["GOOGL.pay.neoTotal.2025","GOOGL.pay.neoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The table puts the value of $100 held in the company’s shares over the years it covers at $360.95 at the end of FY2025, and $138.27 for the peer group the company chose.","cites":["GOOGL.pay.tsr.2025","GOOGL.pay.peerTsr.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $243 billion at the end of FY2025, against $93.2 billion a year earlier. That is 60.3% of FY2025 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["GOOGL.rpo.2025","GOOGL.rpo.2024","GOOGL.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $8.6 billion at the end of FY2025 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $6 billion a year earlier.","cites":["GOOGL.deferred.2025","GOOGL.deferred.2024"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 190,820 in its own words. FY2025 revenue works out to about $2.1 million for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["GOOGL.q.employees","GOOGL.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2025 the balance sheet carried $30.7 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $96.1 billion in short-term investments, and $48.5 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent + LongTermDebtCurrent + CommercialPaper). Cash and short-term investments exceeded that debt by $78.3 billion (computed from five filed figures).","cites":["GOOGL.cash.2025","GOOGL.sti.2025","GOOGL.debtLong.2025","GOOGL.debtCurrent.2025","GOOGL.debtShort.2025"]}]},"fin":{"GOOGL":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":173,"read":173,"other":7,"failed":0,"odd":0,"people":[["Hennessy John L.","Director"],["ARNOLD FRANCES","Director"],["Saraci Marsida","VP, Chief Accounting Officer"],["WALKER JOHN KENT","President, Global Affairs, CLO"],["O'Toole Amie Thuener","VP, Chief Accounting Officer"],["Pichai Sundar","Chief Executive Officer, director"]],"rows":[["S",0,300,90000,"2026-11-12","2026-11-12","0001193125-26-463983","2026-11-16",1],["S",1,82,23288,"2026-10-29","2026-10-29","0001193125-26-442116","2026-10-30",1],["S",1,83,28257.35,"2026-09-30","2026-09-30","0001193125-26-412669","2026-10-02",1],["S",1,82,27692.22,"2026-08-28","2026-08-28","0001193125-26-377149","2026-08-31",1],["S",1,82,27337.98,"2026-07-30","2026-07-30","0001193125-26-326284","2026-07-30",1],["S",2,449,149606.8,"2026-07-29","2026-07-29","0001193125-26-324312","2026-07-29",1],["S",1,112,39343.36,"2026-06-30","2026-06-30","0001193125-26-290710","2026-06-30",1],["S",3,8998,3142915.58,"2026-06-29","2026-06-29","0001193125-26-292904","2026-07-01",1],["S",2,449,153432.28,"2026-06-26","2026-06-26","0001193125-26-289028","2026-06-29",1],["S",0,1050,387063.35,"2026-06-15","2026-06-15","0001193125-26-276111","2026-06-18",1],["S",1,102,38862,"2026-05-29","2026-05-29","0001193125-26-252002","2026-06-01",1],["S",0,1050,412919.85,"2026-05-15","2026-05-15","0001193125-26-231383","2026-05-19",1],["S",1,102,37842,"2026-04-30","2026-04-30","0001193125-26-201851","2026-05-01",1],["S",0,1050,348232.37,"2026-04-15","2026-04-15","0001193125-26-162189","2026-04-17",1],["S",4,617,178701.71,"2026-04-01","2026-04-01","0001193125-26-142372","2026-04-03",1],["S",1,102,28069.38,"2026-03-30","2026-03-30","0001193125-26-135258","2026-03-31",1],["S",3,8993,2481116.95,"2026-03-27","2026-03-27","0001193125-26-135334","2026-0